				Comments = "Create a flow consisting of:\r\n- ParticleEmitter , ParticleCustom and ParticleRender\r\n- A Camera connected to the Particles via a 3DMerge\r\n- A Text+ or some other imagecreating tool.\r\n\r\nIncrease the PEm's Region to about 5\r\n\r\nRaise the PEm's number to about 10.000, animate it at frame 0\r\nand step back to a number of 10 at frame 1.\r\n\r\nAdjust your camera so that you can see a good portion of the ParticleSystem.\r\n\r\nAdd a Projector and ensure that it lines up perfectly with your camera.\r\nAs an alternative you could copy your camera and use the copy as a projector.\r\n\r\nLet the Projector project your text or image on the particles.\r\n(switch on 'light' in the viewport to see the effect)\r\n\r\nGo to frame 75 and animate the Camera's position and rotation.\r\n\r\nGo back to frame 0 and move the camera around\r\nuntil you have an interesting looking perspective.\r\n\r\nExperiment with the Alpha-value in the color-controls of the PEm's style-tab.\r\n\r\n\r\nHave Phun!\r\n\r\n\r\nEric,\r\n",
